 "#7dc4e4", "file": "\u2070 \ud83e\udded Cercle B\u00e9ni \ud83e\udded/\u00b9 \ud83c\udfa5 Audiovisuel/Samurai Champloo.md", "subpath": null}, {"type": "file", "id": "3b970bab807347a2", "x": 4424, "y": -2755, "width": 700, "height": 950, "color": "#a6c8ff", "file": "\u2070 \ud83e\udded Cercle B\u00e9ni \ud83e\udded/\u00b9 \ud83c\udfa5 Audiovisuel/Super Crooks.md", "subpath": null}, {"type": "file", "id": "e8fbe80b672242f8", "x": 4562, "y": -1533, "width": 700, "height": 950, "color": "#7dc4e4", "file": "\u2070 \ud83e\udded Cercle B\u00e9ni \ud83e\udded/\u00b9 \ud83c\udfa5 Audiovisuel/Templat audiovisuel.md", "subpath": null}, {"type": "file", "id": "2a04e36c14414704", "x": 4315, "y": -327, "width": 700, "height": 950, "color": "#a6c8ff", "file": "\u2070 \ud83e\udded Cercle B\u00e9ni \ud83e\udded/\u00b9 \ud83c\udfa5 Audiovisuel/Truman show.md", "subpath": null}, {"type": "file", "id": "e390611fea194eb1", "x": 3708, "y": 742, "width": 700, "height": 950, "color": "#7dc4e4", "file": "\u2070 \ud83e\udded Cercle B\u00e9ni \ud83e\udded/\u00b9 \ud83c\udfa5 Audiovisuel/\u00c0 l'Ouest, rien de nouveau.md", "subpath": null}, {"type": "text", "id": "1b82ee2a4168435a", "x": 1624, "y": -358, "width": 380, "height": 98, "color": "6", "text": "Arcane et L'attaque des titans denoncent l'oppression et les rapports de pouvoir dans la societe."}, {"type": "text", "id": "5e5950ee4cfd42be", "x": 461, "y": -2087, "width": 380, "height": 124, "color": "6", "text": "Arcane, JoJo (Golden Wind), L'attaque des titans et Le Vent se l\u00e8ve explorent le sacrifice et la loyaute comme moteurs de l'intrigue."}, {"type": "text", "id": "4f48e1820c8740ac", "x": 2121, "y": -1773, "width": 380, "height": 98, "color": "6", "text": "L'attaque des titans, L\u00e9on, Vinland Saga et Dorohedoro explorent la vengeance comme moteur principal de l'action."}, {"type": "text", "id": "b112c88112fd4cb7", "x": 1310, "y": -373, "width": 380, "height": 124, "color": "6", "text": "L'attaque des titans, Vinland Saga, \u00c0 l'Ouest, rien de nouveau et Cyberpunk Edgerunners placent la survie au coeur de l'enjeu narratif."}, {"type": "text", "id": "6133192fd6ec4675", "x": -245, "y": -1869, "width": 380, "height": 124, "color": "6", "text": "JoJo (Golden Wind), Le Vent se l\u00e8ve, Mononoke, Complots et Dorohedoro integrent une dimension surnaturelle ou mystique dans leur univers."}, {"type": "text", "id": "b09f4b479634406a", "x": -255, "y": -936, "width": 380, "height": 176, "color": "6", "text": "Arcane, L'attaque des titans, Pluto, REDLINE, BoJack Horseman, Vinland Saga, \u00c0 l'Ouest, rien de nouveau, Complots, Cowboy Bebop et Cyberpunk Edgerunners se situent dans un contexte technologique ou dystopique."}], "edges": [{"id": "d531c0de8313423c", "fromNode": "a3537323c8a14dd0", "fromSide": "right", "fromEnd": null, "toNode": "f2526c75e4a84010", "toSide": "left", "toEnd": null, "color": "1", "label": "tag"}, {"id": "fa882a3f9c68415a", "fromNode": "f2526c75e4a84010", "fromSide": "right", "fromEnd": null, "toNode": "0a8050b4e44e4212", "toSide": "left", "toEnd": null, "color": "#cba6f7", "label": null}, {"id": "4df7a49904f94f98", "fromNode": "f2526c75e4a84010", "fromSide": "right", "fromEnd": null, "toNode": "eb57ed695b684965", "toSide": "left", "toEnd": null, "color": "#cba6f7", "label": null}, {"id": "da31547484634efb", "fromNode": "a3537323c8a14dd0", "fromSide": "bottom", "fromEnd": null, "toNode": "83dfaf6c952345b3", "toSide": "top", "toEnd": null, "color": "1", "label": "tag"}, {"id": "16b1be2558ff49a7", "fromNode": "83dfaf6c952345b3", "fromSide": "bottom", "fromEnd": null, "toNode": "625f34917aa44bf3", "toSide": "top", "toEnd": null, "color": "#a6e3a1", "label": null}, {"id": "bf6cd5126f764daf", "fromNode": "a3537323c8a14dd0", "fromSide": "bottom", "fromEnd": null, "toNode": "d046b05ba09e42e9", "toSide": "top", "toEnd": null, "color": "1", "label": "tag"}, {"id": "079d4750381f4aad", "fromNode": "d046b05ba09e42e9", "fromSide": "bottom", "fromEnd": null, "toNode": "e2f390b0ff0